      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Berserker 8</p><p>When the berserker fails a Will saving throw, he can attempt another Will saving throw at the end of his next turn (using the original DC). If the second saving throw is successful, the berserker is treated as if he succeeded at the first saving throw, negating or reducing the effect as determined by the spell or effect. If this second saving throw fails, the berserker suffers the full effects of the spell or effect as normal.</p>",
